1
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:05,007
(Sheldon:)This is a live shot of Kripke's lab
via a mini webcam I was able to install...

2
00:00:05,179 --> 00:00:09,139
(Sheldon:)...thanks to a dollar bill discreetly placed
in the night janitor's shirt pocket.

3
00:00:09,308 --> 00:00:12,688
(Sheldon:)At the same time, I also secured
large quantities of these chemicals...

4
00:00:12,853 --> 00:00:15,733
(Sheldon:)...above the tiles in the drop ceiling.

5
00:00:15,898 --> 00:00:19,818
(Raj:)Sheldon, you remind me
of a young Lex Luthor.

6
00:00:21,487 --> 00:00:23,817
(Sheldon:)You flatter me, sir.

7
00:00:23,989 --> 00:00:25,989
(Leonard:)-Let me guess, motion sensors?
-Yes.

8
00:00:26,158 --> 00:00:29,998
(Sheldon:)The reaction will be triggered when
Kripke reaches the center of the room.

9
00:00:30,245 --> 00:00:32,625
Mwa, ha, ha.

10
00:00:34,833 --> 00:00:37,503
(Leonard:)I gotta say, I am really impressed.

11
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:40,210
(Leonard:)This is truly the Sheldon Cooper way
to get even.

12
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:42,301
[FARTING SOUND]

13
00:00:46,553 --> 00:00:47,593
(Sheldon:)It may be low-tech...

14
00:00:47,805 --> 00:00:51,435
(Sheldon:)...but I still maintain
the whoopee cushion has comic validity.

15
00:00:52,518 --> 00:00:53,848
(Raj:)Here comes Kripke.

16
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,940
LEONARD:
Who's that with him?

17
00:00:56,105 --> 00:00:58,435
RAJESH: I believe that's the president
of the university.

18
00:00:58,607 --> 00:01:01,397
(Leonard:)-The board of directors. Abort! Abort!
-There is no abort.

